Finally, our experience with explainability tools like SHAP, LIME, chain-of-thought prompting, and RAG source citation will be used to provide transparent and interpretable results from the intelligent assistance tool. This technical architecture should meet the client's requirements while ensuring a secure, scalable, and efficient solution.
